  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin067-xiyin:xuguang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin067-xiyin:xuguang:m0000" ref="eb9_035_485">江虨</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-jin067-xiyin:xuguang:m0003" ref="eb9_035_485">思玄</persName>，陳留人。博學知名，兼善弈，爲中興之冠。累遷尚書左僕射、護軍將軍。</p>
